right-outlined\"><path fill=\"none\" stroke=\"none\" d=\"M0 0h24v24H0z\"></path><path stroke=\"currentColor\" d=\"M17 7l-10 10\"></path><path stroke=\"currentColor\" d=\"M8 7l9 0l0 9\"></path></svg></span></a></p><!--/$--></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div role=\"tabpanel\"><!--$--><div><div><div><p><span>Access multiple models</span><span data-state=\"closed\" data-slot=\"tooltip-trigger\"><span>Model List</span><span><svg width=\"1em\" height=\"1em\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" focusable=\"false\" color=\"currentColor\" data-icon=\"exclamation-circle-outlined\"><path fill=\"none\" stroke=\"none\" d=\"M0 0h24v24H0z\"></path><path stroke=\"currentColor\" d=\"M3 12a9 9 0 1 0 18 0a9 9 0 1 0 -18 0\"></path><path stroke=\"currentColor\" d=\"M12 9v4\"></path><path stroke=\"currentColor\" d=\"M12 16v.01\"></path></svg></span></span></p></div><div><p><span>Run 1–2 agents concurrently</span></p></div></div><div><div><p><span>4x the credits of Lite Plan</span></p></div><div><p><span>Run 3–4 agents concurrently</span></p></div></div><div><div><p><span>16x the credits of Lite Plan</span></p></div><div><p><span>Everything in Standard Plan</span></p></div><div><p><span>Run 6–8 agents concurrently</span></p></div></div></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div><!--$--><h2>Supported<!-- --> <!-- -->AI<!-- --> <!-- -->Tools</h2><!--/$--><!--$--><p>Token Plan works with mainstream tools that support OpenAI and Anthropic protocols<a href=\"https://docs.qwencloud.com/token-plan/tools/openclaw\" target=\"_blank\">Learn More<span><svg width=\"1em\" height=\"1em\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" focusable=\"false\" color=\"currentColor\" data-icon=\"arrow-up-right-outlined\"><path fill=\"none\" stroke=\"none\" d=\"M0 0h24v24H0z\"></path><path stroke=\"currentColor\" d=\"M17 7l-10 10\"></path><path stroke=\"cur